menu "board_timer"

    config BOARD_TIMER_TASK_PRIO
        int "Task priority"
        default 7
        range 1 24
        help
          Runs every board timer's callback (a motor's ramp, a poll, a
          timeout). Above the event task (6), so a step is not held up by
          event listeners; below the urgent task (15).

    config BOARD_TIMER_TASK_STACK
        int "Task stack (bytes)"
        default 4096
        range 3072 32768
        help
          The callbacks run on it: a driver's step with its bus calls (I2C)
          and the device calls it makes.

endmenu
